{"translation":{"id":"pan_irv","name":"ਇੰਡਿਅਨ ਰਿਵਾਇਜ਼ਡ ਵਰਜ਼ਨ (IRV) - ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Punjabi Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"pan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"7bcf70d369a169a12ac867ce44def25b36147b72029339f8c8d3c7a06bab588d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","languageEnglishName":"Punjabi"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"pan_irv","name":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","commonName":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","title":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a1b7c5c3025a80671b87659256d14a42fb58ace987b687a83db2b26ac8a5d95","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":125,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ਪਰਮੇਸ਼ੁਰ ਦੇ ਲੋਕਾਂ ਦੀ ਸੁਰੱਖਿਆ"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ਦਾਊਦ ਦਾ ਯਾਤਰਾ ਦਾ ਗੀਤ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ਜਿਹੜੇ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਉੱਤੇ ਭਰੋਸਾ ਰੱਖਦੇ ਹਨ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਹ ਸੀਯੋਨ ਦੇ ਪਰਬਤ ਵਰਗੇ ਹਨ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜੋ ਕਦੇ ਡੋਲਦਾ ਨਹੀਂ ਸਗੋਂ ਸਦਾ ਲਈ ਅਟੱਲ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜਿਵੇਂ ਪਰਬਤ ਯਰੂਸ਼ਲਮ ਦੇ ਆਲੇ-ਦੁਆਲੇ ਹਨ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤਿਵੇਂ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਆਪਣੀ ਪਰਜਾ ਦੇ ਆਲੇ-ਦੁਆਲੇ ਹੈ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹੁਣ ਤੋਂ ਲੈ ਕੇ ਸਦੀਪਕ ਕਾਲ ਤੱਕ ਹੈ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਦੁਸ਼ਟਾਂ ਦਾ ਰਾਜ-ਡੰਡ ਧਰਮੀਆਂ ਦੇ ਉੱਤੇ ਬਣਿਆ ਨਾ ਰਹੇਗਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਜਿਹਾ ਨਾ ਹੋਵੇ ਕਿ ਧਰਮੀ ਆਪਣੇ ਹੱਥ ਬਦੀ ਵੱਲ ਵਧਾਉਣ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹੇ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ, ਭਲਿਆਂ ਨਾਲ ਭਲਿਆਈ ਕਰ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਸਿੱਧੇ ਮਨ ਵਾਲਿਆਂ ਨਾਲ ਵੀ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਪਰ ਜਿਹੜੇ ਆਪਣੇ ਪੁੱਠੇ ਰਾਹਾਂ ਵੱਲ ਭਟਕ ਜਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਕੁਕਰਮੀਆਂ ਦੇ ਨਾਲ ਚਲਾਵੇਗਾ!","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਇਸਰਾਏਲ ਉੱਤੇ ਸਲਾਮਤੀ ਹੋਵੇ।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/125.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/126.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/124.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}